{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國男星宋仲基於2019年與女星宋慧喬離婚，2023年初與英國前女星Katy Louise Saunders再婚，現時育有一對子女。</p><p>最近網民翻炒他前年演出網絡節目的片段，被問到妻子最擅長的韓國料理時，他笑着大讚妻子手藝：「那個人真的很厲害！</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.235669+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T08:08:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"b132c58e8628a87311c9a49dda5e35866b9e8245997a86a2e3a9c657b10e0c3a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}